  #     response. Note the following important requirements and
  #     restrictions:
  #
  #     * You must rename the `ETag` field to `IfMatch`, leaving the value
  #       unchanged. (Set the value of `IfMatch` to the value of `ETag`,
  #       then remove the `ETag` field.)
